The aTPR risk-standardization framework follows the fairRisk work of
Sarah E. Hegarty and colleagues. The research scripts from which this package
was refactored used fairRisk version 1.0.1.2 for calibration, density-ratio
estimation, and aTPR aggregation.

Tested upstream dependency:
  Package: fairRisk, version 1.1.1.1
  Author: Sarah Hegarty
  License: MIT
  Copyright (c) 2024 fairRisk authors
  Recorded source: sarahhegarty/fairRisk
  Recorded revision: e8e0f8b6bc58f29fec68acb070064940ac88d13c
  Project reference: https://github.com/sarahhegarty/aTPR-estimation

This package requires fairRisk and calls its exported calibrate,
estDensityRatio, and get_aTPR functions. It adds AIPW pseudo-outcome construction,
augmented calibration, and influence-function inference. The upstream license
notice is retained below for adapted portions of the research implementation.

